  "content": "<h1><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">河流更新！1！</span></strong></h1>\n<h1>📦 <span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><strong>關於</strong></span></h1>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">VietNam Delight 是 <a style=\"color:#bfedd2\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight（農夫的富足）</a> 的模組擴充，增添了傳統的越南料理。</span></h3>\n<h1><strong>🌿 </strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>功能特色</strong></span></h1>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>- 新增 Xôi（糯米飯）、Bánh chưng（越南方形粽子）等。</strong><br></span></h3>\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">- 新增多種來自越南的傳統料理與地方特色美食。</span></strong></h3>\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">- 新增功能性方塊，如大型烹飪鍋、木桶等。</span></strong></h3>\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">- 新增新植物、樹苗、水果等。</span></strong></h3>\n<h1><strong>⚙ 更新日誌 <span style=\"color:#ba372a\">!</span></strong></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Huwng8\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\"><strong>將於此處發布/更新</strong></span></a></span></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">&nbsp;</span></strong></h1>",
